  "body": "A considered transformation. A coveted coastal setting. An exceptional opportunity.\r\n\r\nSome homes captivate through their character. Others through the lifestyle they promise. This distinctive Devonport residence brings both together, uniting the enduring charm of its origins with a thoughtful contemporary renovation, versatile living and the enduring appeal of a sought-after coastal address.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully renovated to balance authenticity with modern functionality, the home offers an immediate sense of comfort and understated sophistication. Its single level design, established gardens and 556sqm freehold site create a compelling sense of space, privacy and ease, complemented by the quiet appeal of a sought-after cul-de-sac position.\r\n\r\nStep inside and experience the home from every perspective. The VIDEO TOUR reveals its inviting interiors, considered renovation and effortless connection between indoor and outdoor living, bringing to life the details that make this residence so distinctive.\r\n\r\nAt 113sqm, the intelligently configured interior is designed around the rhythms of modern life. Three bedrooms, two bathrooms including a master ensuite, and generous living provide versatility without compromise. An open wood fireplace lends warmth and character, while entertaining decks to the front and rear extend the living environment outdoors. A single garage and additional off-street parking add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nBeyond the interiors, the grounds offer an equally compelling dimension. Established planting, a generous flat lawn and a north-west-facing rear garden create an inviting setting for entertaining, unwinding and enjoying the outdoors. A separate garden studio provides valuable flexibility, whether for working from home, creative pursuits or a private retreat. Together, these features deliver a home that adapts beautifully to changing needs without compromising its character or sense of place.\r\n\r\nThe location elevates the offering further. Cheltenham Beach, local cafes and neighbouring shops are moments away, while Devonport Village, its distinctive boutiques and eateries, and the ferry connection to Auckland's central business district are within easy reach. Waterfront reserves, coastal walks and sought-after schooling complete a lifestyle where convenience and community sit naturally alongside the pleasures of seaside living.\r\n\r\nImagine mornings beside the water, coffee at a favourite local, evenings gathered around the fire and weekends spent enjoying the garden. Here, these simple pleasures become part of the everyday, balanced by effortless access to the city and the tranquillity of an established residential setting.\r\n\r\nFor families, professional couples, discerning downsizers and those seeking a lifestyle change, this is an opportunity to secure a home with genuine breadth of appeal. The convergence of thoughtful renovation, versatile accommodation, substantial flat freehold land and proximity to the coast creates a compelling proposition in one of Auckland's most cherished seaside communities.\r\n\r\nNow ready for its next custodians, this is a home to experience in person and an opportunity to pursue with confidence. Character, functionality and location come together in a residence that offers not simply a place to live, but a lifestyle to embrace.\r\n\r\nProudly marketed by The EK Group, delivering prestige, passion, and property without parallel.",
